OL,3,GNEWSAArson investigators 'aware of
OL,4,Aonline fire trend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating several suspected
OL,7,Farson attacks in rural Herefordshire
OL,8,Fhave said they are "aware of a trend on
OL,9,Fsocial media relating to the starting
OL,10,Fof fires".
OL,12,FWest Mercia Police said a fire was
OL,13,Freported in Kinnersley at about 02:30
OL,14,FBST on Sunday, 23 August, followed by
OL,15,Fanother near Norton Canon at about
OL,16,F02:50.
OL,18,FBoth were in agricultural buildings
OL,19,Fabout three miles apart and are being
OL,20,Ftreated as arson.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
